title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Alerts
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check evaluates the XAPI messages (alerts shown in XenCenter / Xen
 Orchestra) of the configured time window (default 24 hours), fetched by the
 special agent {agent_xenserver}.

 Priority 1 and 2 alerts are {CRIT}, priority 3 {WARN}, priority 4 (service
 recovered) {OK} by default. Informational messages (priority 5) are only
 counted. Single alerts can be ignored via regular expressions.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer Alerts} is created if alert fetching is enabled.
